  "job_B1.4.23_20251001_193238": {
    "chunk_text": "Wyrdwriteras us secga\u00f0, \u00f0a \u00f0e awritan be cyningum, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea ealdan cyningas on \u00f0am \u00e6rran timan \u00d0a gesetton \u00fea cyningas, him sylfum to fultume, ealdormen under him, and hi oft asendon to manegum Dauid se m\u00e6ra cyning, \u00feeah \u00f0e he cene w\u00e6re, he asende his heretogan, swa swa hit seg\u00f0 on leden on factum est ergo, uertente anno, eo tempore quo solent reges procedere ad bella, misit dauid ioab, et Dauid se cyning asende eft ioab on \u00f0am o\u00f0ran geare to \u00f0am ammoniscum, and he oferwann hi mid \u00fe\u00e6s dixit ergo dauid, nunc magis aflicturus est nos siba filius bochri, et cetera. Siba w\u00e6s gehaten sum dauides \u00feegena, se astyrode \u00fe\u00e6t folc mid feondlicre spr\u00e6ce ongean \u00feone cyning \u00d0a fleah se siba mid fleamdome aweg; ac ioab se heretoga his heafod begeat \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6re burhware \u00fee he to factum est autem rursum prelium aduersus israhel philistinorum, et cetera. Eft w\u00e6s geworden wi\u00f0 israhel gefeoht; on \u00f0am gefeohte w\u00e6s sum wundorlic ent se wolde ofslean \u00feone \u00d0a sworon sona \u00f0\u00e6s cyninges \u00f0egenas ealle, and s\u00e6don him \u00feus to: ne scealt \u00f0u n\u00e6fre heonon for\u00f0 mid Constantinus, se casere \u00f0e \u00e6rest beah to cristendome, h\u00e6fde \u00e6nne heretogan se hatte gallicanus, \u00feone And se gallicanus wear\u00f0 sy\u00f0\u00f0an swa halig \u00fe\u00e6t he wundra worhte and wear\u00f0 gemartirod for criste, sw",
